{"id":"f556f909a8","t":"I Will Buy Divine Power With Money","c":"cv","n":63,"l":64,"s":["ml","az"],"k":{"ml":"i-will-buy-divine-power-with-money","az":"i-will-buy-divine-power-with-money"},"u":1795514092596,"desc":"بعد موتها، تجد بطلة الرواية نفسها في روايةٍ كقديسةٍ وشريرةٍ مزيفة. لإنقاذ العالم، عليها جمع مبلغٍ ضخمٍ من المال لترميم إله الشمس. وبينما تُكافح للحفاظ على معبدٍ فقيرٍ طافيًا، يبدأ من حولها بالثقة بها وحمايتها، حتى أن بعضهم يعلم أنها ليست حقيقية. لكن هذا العالم يبدو غريبًا جدًا لدرجة أنه لا يُمكن اعتباره مجرد خيال. كل ما تريده هو أن ترقد بسلامٍ أخيرًا.","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["دراما","رومانسى","شوجو","فانتازيا","مانهوا"],"src":{"ml":"i-will-buy-divine-power-with-money","az":"i-will-buy-divine-power-with-money"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"i-will-buy-divine-power-with-money|/manga/i-will-buy-divine-power-with-money/1/","az":"i-will-buy-divine-power-with-money|/series/i-will-buy-divine-power-with-money/chapter-1"},"2":{"ml":"i-will-buy-divine-power-with-money|/manga/i-will-buy-divine-power-with-money/2/"},"3":{"ml":"i-will-buy-divine-power-with-money|/manga/i-will-buy-divine-power-with-money/3/"},"4":{"ml":"i-will-buy-divine-power-with-money|/manga/i-will-buy-divine-power-with-money/4/"},"5":{"ml":"i-will-buy-divine-power-with-money|/manga/i-will-buy-divine-power-with-money/5/"},"6":{"ml":"i-will-buy-divine-power-with-money|/manga/i-will-buy-divine-power-with-money/6/"},"7":{"ml":"i-will-buy-divine-power-with-money|/manga/i-will-buy-divine-power-with-money/7/"},"8":{"ml":"i-will-buy-divine-power-with-money|/manga/i-will-buy-divine-power-with-money/8/"},"9":{"ml":"i-will-buy-divine-power-with-money|/manga/i-will-buy-divine-power-with-money/9/"},"10":{"ml":"i-will-buy-divine-power-with-money|/manga/i-will-buy-divine-power-with-money/10/"},"11":{"ml":"i-will-buy-divine-power-with-money|/manga/i-will-buy-divine-power-with-money/11/"},"12":{"ml":"i-will-buy-divine-power-with-money|/manga/i-will-buy-divine-power-with-money/12/"},"13":{"ml":"i-will-buy-d